{"ID":"20240513082949-5y6wtwg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513082949-5y6wtwg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513082949-5y6wtwg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175430-pmmx7mh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175430-pmmx7mh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:306,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175430-pmmx7mh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:450,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:450\u0026#125;","title":"338","type":"doc","updated":"20240515110121"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513175430-pmmx7mh","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 925px;","id":"20240513175430-pmmx7mh","updated":"20240515110121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"237-7 S, N "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中等 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"05/15/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃癌，胃已切除75%西醫檢查血鉀過高，服西藥中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡不深"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 體力不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 胃口不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 大便正常(淡褐色)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 小便淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 口渴有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 身無寒熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白鮮黃厚苔("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"濕很盛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區結構不好("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因為西藥損傷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") 右眼有褐點"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中焦濕過盛且熱, 肝損傷, 無法解毒."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1) 四神湯 蔗糖一包 七付 煮來當甜食吃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2) 柴胡三錢 黃芩三錢 玉金五錢 龍膽草三錢 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"清肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮三錢 茯苓五錢 澤瀉五錢 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡滲利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢 白芍五錢 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝為血臟, 活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茜草三錢 炙鱉甲三錢 茵陳三錢 梔子三錢 生薑三片 陳皮三錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"開胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚樸二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮成三碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3) HT-40, (烏梅丸，苦溫化腸胃之濕)一次30粒早晚飯後服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 此人在胃開刀後, 服約十二種西藥, 這是西藥傷肝故無法將體內多餘毒素排出造成. 需清肝. "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 因為肝不解毒，濁陰(血)進入心，心神無法藏於其中，故失眠(心臟受損)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人宜暫時戒食木瓜及香蕉"}]}]}]}]}